<title>USA: Evans Systems hires financial advisor.</title>
<headline>Evans Systems hires financial advisor.</headline>
<dateline>BAY CITY, Texas 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evans Systems Inc said Tuesday that it has hired Growth Capital Partners of Houston as its strategic financial advisor to recommend business alternatives, which may include selling assets.</p>
<p>Growth Capital will recommend alternatives and prepare a three-to-five year business plan to improve shareholder value. Its report is due May 31.</p>
<p>The company said that its reported book value is $6.50 a share and that it is looking for ways to better utilize its resources, which may include selling assets that no longer fit into its long-term goals.</p>
</text>
